A2 r7 idea36: FX carry L/S weekly top1/bot1 by (foreign10y - US2y) pct rank; pairs JPY,EUR,GBP,CAD 2018-02..2026-08 (foreign yields monthly FRED, lag 1mo PIT; US rate daily data_fred_new/DGS2). Accrual ydiff/100/252 added daily (true carry); T+1, 6bps/side, vt10 trailing expanding min60 lag1. Rationale: uncovered-interest-parity violation - high-yield vs low-yield currency appreciates on average; accrual is the actual carry (spot-only SR 0.25). Book = short JPY (SR .74) + long GBP (.45), EUR .30, CAD -.16. GATES: full SR 0.85>=0.6; plateau: W/M/Q rebal 0.61-0.88, top/bot 1/2 variants 0.56-0.88, 5 US-rate proxies all 0.85; halves H1 0.53/H2 1.15; negyr 2 worst -5.0%; scramble(n=1000,seed7,pre-vt) p=0.0420; subperiod SR 18-21 0.20 / 22-26 1.38; corr champion 0.07, max|corr| library 0.10. CAVEATS (disclosed): (1) charter r7 mission bar SR>=1.0 NOT met (0.85) - saved as campaign-brief passer (all brief gates pass); (2) window 8.5y only - foreign yields on disk start 2018; NO 2008 carry-crash test (book shorts JPY, 2008-style unwind would hurt); (3) scramble marginal: 500x3 seeds p=0.030-0.054; (4) costs trivial (0.00086/d turnover = 0.005bp/d) - result is not cost-tested. Coordinator: treat as conditional diversifier pending longer-window foreign-rate data (OECD/BIS daily or 2000s monthly policy rates).